                                "sense_id": "93fa37c3-580e-3e56-ba37-7f07e9d2cc74",
                                "text": "\"Pugh!\" says Sophia. \"There! no, no: what should he do there? He is gone before this time, to be sure. Besides, why—what—why should you go to see? besides, I want you for something else. Go, fetch me my hat and gloves. I shall walk with my aunt in the grove before dinner.\""
                            }
